WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Welcome to our wrong item sent product compliance training.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.187
A wrong item sent product condition issue occurs when a customer receives a product they consider

00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:11.080
different from the one they ordered.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:18.493
Customers may think that the product they received is not the one that they ordered when it doesn't

00:00:18.493 --> 00:00:23.714
match the expected color, pattern, size, quantity or material described on the relevant product

00:00:23.714 --> 00:00:24.460
detail page.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:31.269
Doesn't match the specific country, version or model described on the product detail page or it's

00:00:31.269 --> 00:00:33.680
a totally different product than was ordered.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.617
Let's meet Lee.

00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:40.400
Lee was excited to find a brand ABC shirt in blue in the Amazon store.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:45.871
She'd been looking for this particular shirt in blue for her son's birthday, but hadn't been able

00:00:45.871 --> 00:00:46.980
to find it anywhere.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.740
Lee ordered the shirt with excitement and any company shipped the order.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:56.900
When Lee opened the package, she found that the shirt that had been delivered was red.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.500
Lee was disappointed, returned the shirt and complained to Amazon.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:09.015
Any company sent the wrong item and is not complying with Amazon's seller code of conduct, product

00:01:09.015 --> 00:01:12.480
authenticity and quality guidelines and condition guidelines.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:18.394
If you receive a notification from Amazon related to a wrong item sent, you should determine the

00:01:18.394 --> 00:01:21.780
root cause of the issue to prevent future customer complaints.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:25.780
Mateo sells multiple products in the Amazon store.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:31.833
He monitors what his customers say about his products by signing in to seller central and regularly

00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:36.120
reviewing buyer messages using the buyer seller messaging service.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:43.291
Customer feedback, product reviews, A to Z claims, returns, the customer complaint summary and the

00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:44.520
voice of the customer dashboard.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.040
Here are some tips to prevent sending the wrong item to a customer.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:55.485
Tip number one, describe your products clearly and upload accurate images to the product's detail

00:01:55.485 --> 00:01:58.240
page so that customers know what to expect.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:05.960
Tip number two, regularly carry out internal checks and audits to review quality control processes.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:12.620
Tip number three, inspect your products to ensure they function correctly and match their descriptions

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.040
on the detail pages.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.320
Tip number four, work with trustworthy suppliers to ensure you list quality products.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:27.054
Tip number five, train your staff to verify that your products contain all the correct parts and

00:02:27.054 --> 00:02:32.674
are placed in the correct packaging and ensure they send the correct version of a product for a

00:02:32.674 --> 00:02:33.240
specific order.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:40.680
Tip number six, check that all products are labeled correctly and validate your product's variations.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:48.220
Tip number seven, carry out an audit of your inventory if you receive a wrong item sent notification

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:52.160
to check that the remaining inventory doesn't have the same issue.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:58.460
And tip number eight, label and store returned products separately to avoid confusion.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:03.320
Ensure that issues with returned products aren't passed on to other customers.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:07.380
To find help pages with information on preventing these issues,

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:13.940
go to Seller Central and type preventing product condition issues, product authenticity and quality

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:18.080
and condition guidelines in the search field at the top of the page.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:24.628
It's important to note that non-compliance with Amazon's policies may affect your ability to sell

00:03:24.628 --> 00:03:26.020
in the Amazon store.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:31.480
Remember to keep your account health from being affected by wrong item sent violations.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:37.320
Always ensure that customers receive the product as it's described on the product detail page.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.380
This concludes our wrong item sent product compliance training.

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.900
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
